  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "M3uozkeRv867BQK02GgDW08Eus4=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-14T12:35:42.000Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "There are two tiers, and the difference is how much analytics-path vocabulary leaks into your component.\n\n**Raw tier** \u2014 `useAnalyticsQuery` from `@powerhousedao/reactor-browser/analytics` takes the same `AnalyticsQuery` the engine takes: luxon `DateTime` bounds, an `AnalyticsGranularity`, and `select`/`lod` maps keyed by dimension name with `AnalyticsPath.fromString(...)` values.\n\n```tsx\nconst { data, isLoading } = useAnalyticsQuery({\n  start: DateTime.now().minus({ days: 7 }),\n  end: DateTime.now(),\n  granularity: AnalyticsGranularity.Daily,\n  metrics: [\"DriveOperations\"],\n  select: { drive: [AnalyticsPath.fromString(`ph/drive/${driveId}`)] },\n  lod: { drive: 1 },\n});\n```\n\n**Friendly tier** \u2014 `useDriveAnalytics` and `useDocumentAnalytics` from `@powerhousedao/common/drive-analytics` take plain strings and a different time vocabulary: `filters` (`driveId`, `operation`, `actionType`, `documentId`, `target`, `branch`, `scope`), `from`/`to` as ISO strings, `granularity`, and `levelOfDetail` instead of `lod`. They build the paths for you and delegate to `useAnalyticsQuery`.\n\nThe second argument of `useAnalyticsQuery` is where live updating lives. Pass `{ sources: [AnalyticsPath.fromString(...)] }` and the query refetches when new series land at or under that source; add `refetchInterval` for polled monitoring. Without `sources` the result is a one-shot read.\n\nBoth tiers return the standard query-state shape (`data`, `isLoading`), and `data.rows[].dimensions` is what you read to label a chart \u2014 e.g. `row.dimensions.find(d => d.name === \"actionType\")?.path`.\n\nProvenance: draft `04-Reference/04-Processors/_07-DriveAnalyticsHooks.md`; hooks confirmed to exist at `packages/reactor-browser/src/analytics/hooks/analytics-query.ts` and `packages/common/drive-analytics/{useDriveAnalytics,useDocumentAnalytics}.ts` at 6.2.2-dev.45.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-14T12:35:42.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-14T12:35:42.000Z"
    }
  },
